WEBVTT

01:30.520 --> 01:34.000
Someone actually tried to steal
the medicinal herbs from you?

01:34.000 --> 01:37.400
What's baffling is that
those herbs aren't valuable

01:37.400 --> 01:42.400
Why did the bandit take off with
the common herbs instead of my money?

01:42.600 --> 01:46.200
What's more, the imperial dispensary
doesn't stock any of those herbs

01:46.200 --> 01:48.800
And we were robbed
whilst on the mountain

01:48.800 --> 01:51.800
How odd. The imperial dispensary is
a treasure trove of medicinal herbs

01:51.800 --> 01:54.200
Could the mastermind be
behind the robbery?

02:04.800 --> 02:09.200
-Is His Majesty getting better?
-No. He's still bedridden

02:10.200 --> 02:15.400
Don't worry, Your Highness.
His Majesty leads a blessed life

02:15.800 --> 02:19.800
I'm sure Physician Mei has come up
with the prescription

02:20.200 --> 02:23.800
Although I lost the medicinal herbs
meant for His Majesty,

02:23.800 --> 02:25.400
I managed to find the replacement

02:25.400 --> 02:29.800
I can quite safely say His Majesty
will recover from his illness

02:29.800 --> 02:31.400
You've worked hard

02:34.200 --> 02:36.800
Your Highness,
I have a bold request to make

02:36.800 --> 02:37.800
Speak

02:37.800 --> 02:41.480
Would Your Highness brew the medicine
for His Majesty personally?

02:41.480 --> 02:45.000
-I'll see to it right away
-Thank you, Your Highness

03:01.400 --> 03:03.600
Father, you're looking much better

03:04.400 --> 03:05.920
Congratulations, Your Majesty

03:05.920 --> 03:09.000
Her Highness' personal supervision of
the brewing has paid off

03:09.200 --> 03:11.200
Time for my medicine

03:15.200 --> 03:17.600
I shan't take the medicine today

03:17.600 --> 03:20.400
Inform the Imperial Kitchen
to prepare my meals

03:20.400 --> 03:23.800
That's great news! Congratulations
on Your Majesty's recovery

03:23.800 --> 03:26.400
-Be going
-Yes, Your Majesty

03:28.000 --> 03:32.400
I want more pork, beef, mutton,
and duck in my meals

03:35.200 --> 03:38.400
The physician you got for me
was Mei...

03:38.400 --> 03:41.000
-Mei Shouquan!
-That's right. Mei Shouquan

03:41.000 --> 03:45.400
What a queer name. I feel much better
after taking his prescription

03:45.400 --> 03:47.800
In fact, he has a friend
called Wu Fuqi

03:47.800 --> 03:49.400
Wu Fuqi (no blessing)?

03:49.520 --> 03:52.800
-There is also Wei Delu
-Oh, that chap

03:53.200 --> 03:55.200
Mei Shouquan (no longevity),

03:55.200 --> 03:57.800
Wu Fuqi (no blessing) and
Wei Delu (no rank)...

03:57.800 --> 03:59.800
Such depressing names

04:00.000 --> 04:02.200
Put together, their names
mean blessing (fu),

04:02.200 --> 04:04.400
rank (lu) and longevity (shou)!

04:05.200 --> 04:08.200
Blessing, rank and longevity?
That's true

04:08.200 --> 04:10.200
That's auspicious

04:10.800 --> 04:11.800
Father

04:15.800 --> 04:19.800
Father, I have something important
to tell you

04:19.800 --> 04:21.200
What is it?

04:21.200 --> 04:23.800
It's about the essay
by this year's top scholar

04:24.200 --> 04:30.000
I've read it. It touched on
the epidemic in Ping'an Town

04:30.600 --> 04:33.520
Huang Xinxin is a literary talent

04:33.600 --> 04:37.400
But I don't think that
he wrote that piece of essay

04:37.600 --> 04:38.800
No way

04:39.000 --> 04:41.200
Someone cheated in the examination

04:41.200 --> 04:46.000
So who do you think wrote
that piece of essay?

04:46.000 --> 04:47.200
Wei Delu

04:47.400 --> 04:49.400
Wei Delu? Have you any proof?

04:49.600 --> 04:52.400
Father, you could let
the two men confront each other

04:53.400 --> 04:56.400
If I grant an appeal so readily,

04:56.400 --> 04:58.600
the Imperial Court will be in chaos

04:59.000 --> 05:01.400
Father, this matter has
far-reaching consequences

05:01.400 --> 05:05.200
The kingdom is at stake. You must
get to the bottom of things

05:07.200 --> 05:12.000
All right. Summon the two men
to the Palace tomorrow

05:13.000 --> 05:14.200
Wise is Father!

05:31.400 --> 05:33.800
Get up.
Sleep no more

05:33.800 --> 05:35.400
It's late in the day

05:37.400 --> 05:39.800
Get up!

05:44.000 --> 05:47.400
Your breath stinks!
You reek of alcohol

05:47.400 --> 05:50.200
You stink!
When was the last time you bathed?

05:50.200 --> 05:52.400
Why did you become so dispirited?

05:52.400 --> 05:57.200
Stay this way and you'll only
give yourself up to ruin

05:57.200 --> 05:59.400
Even Ma Ruyi has chosen to ignore you

05:59.520 --> 06:03.200
Tell her to leave me alone.
She's such a pain

06:03.200 --> 06:05.200
Spare me from her nagging

06:05.400 --> 06:09.200
I don't deny Ruyi is a pain and a nag

06:09.200 --> 06:11.400
-But of course
-You!

06:13.200 --> 06:15.680
Why is Ruyi such a pain and a nag?

06:15.800 --> 06:20.800
Why did she and Princess Ruining
sneak into the academy...

06:20.800 --> 06:22.800
to steal the examination essays?

06:22.800 --> 06:26.600
Why did she steal the essay and
present it to His Majesty...

06:26.600 --> 06:28.800
in a bid to file an appeal for you?

06:28.800 --> 06:32.000
Why did she do that?
It doesn't pay to be kind

06:34.200 --> 06:36.400
File an appeal? What appeal?

06:36.400 --> 06:40.400
An appeal to find out why
you weren't even in the top three

06:40.400 --> 06:43.200
His Majesty has summoned you

06:43.200 --> 06:45.800
But are you free to see His Majesty?

06:46.200 --> 06:48.200
-His Majesty wants to see me?
-Yes!

06:48.200 --> 06:49.200
Let's go!

06:50.800 --> 06:55.000
-Tell her I'm sorry when you see her
-You tell her personally

06:55.000 --> 06:57.800
An apology made personally
is more sincere

06:58.000 --> 07:02.800
You're my brother. Just a word
from you and she'll forgive me

07:02.800 --> 07:03.800
Well?

07:07.400 --> 07:09.800
Let me look at you.
Done!

07:10.400 --> 07:12.400
-What was I saying?
-Miss Ma

07:13.200 --> 07:16.800
Yes, yes. If I talk to her,
she'll certainly give me a hard time

07:16.800 --> 07:22.000
That's true. You're not me.
She doesn't dare defy my wishes

07:22.200 --> 07:27.400
Really? I'd say you're the one
who doesn't dare defy her wishes

07:27.600 --> 07:29.920
Oh yeah?
I'm showing her respect

07:32.000 --> 07:33.000
Done!

07:33.200 --> 07:36.600
-Why is she so nice to us?
-I'm the reason why!

07:37.400 --> 07:38.800
-Hold it!
-What?

07:41.400 --> 07:44.000
-Look at that
-My view is being blocked

07:44.400 --> 07:46.400
Put my leg down

07:50.200 --> 07:51.800
So cute!

07:53.000 --> 07:55.400
Can you not copy what I say?

07:56.600 --> 08:00.800
So cute!
It's smiling at me

08:03.200 --> 08:05.600
It's looking at you and me

08:07.000 --> 08:09.800
-His Majesty is expecting us
-Yes, His Majesty is expecting us

08:09.800 --> 08:11.400
Goodbye, darling

08:12.400 --> 08:15.800
I have summoned all of you here
only because...

08:15.800 --> 08:19.800
it's been reported that someone
cheated in this year's examination

08:19.800 --> 08:24.400
Hence I've summoned all of you here
to verify the facts

08:24.400 --> 08:26.400
Wise is Your Majesty

08:26.400 --> 08:28.000
Wise is Your Majesty

08:28.200 --> 08:30.800
Is Huang Xinxin,
the new top scholar, present?

08:31.200 --> 08:34.400
Your Majesty, he had a drop
too much last night

08:34.400 --> 08:36.200
He'll be here shortly

08:41.400 --> 08:43.400
Long live Your Majesty...

08:45.400 --> 08:47.400
Are you Huang Xinxin?

08:48.800 --> 08:49.800
Get up!

08:51.200 --> 08:52.800
Wake up!

08:54.200 --> 08:59.400
I want both of you to recite the
essay you wrote at the examination

09:00.400 --> 09:02.200
The essay?

09:02.400 --> 09:06.800
Why do the masses esteem food?
You've come to the right person

09:06.800 --> 09:08.800
I've always loved food

09:09.200 --> 09:13.000
I'll eat anything that is edible

09:13.000 --> 09:19.200
Delicacies from all corners of
the earth have I tasted

09:20.400 --> 09:21.400
Impressive?

09:22.400 --> 09:25.200
Any more nonsense from you and
your head will roll!

09:27.200 --> 09:29.400
Wei Delu, you go

09:31.200 --> 09:35.200
Your humble subject asks
to have it written down instead

09:35.400 --> 09:38.400
In fact, I shall write it
in reverse order

09:39.680 --> 09:43.920
That is a bold request.
Men, prepare the stationery

10:09.200 --> 10:12.400
Your Majesty, the essay is completed

10:12.400 --> 10:15.400
For Your Majesty's perusal, please

10:17.200 --> 10:20.200
Zha Daoguang, examine the essay

10:20.600 --> 10:22.400
Yes, Your Majesty

10:27.800 --> 10:31.400
Your Majesty,
it's the Top Scholar's essay indeed

10:31.400 --> 10:34.400
It's correctly written
even in reverse order

10:35.600 --> 10:38.600
Your Majesty, we have a problem here

10:38.600 --> 10:41.400
Here, Your Lordship.
A stroke is missing

10:43.000 --> 10:45.800
Your Majesty, the character "huang"
has the top stroke missing,

10:45.800 --> 10:48.200
thus implying that
Your Majesty is headless

10:48.200 --> 10:50.200
That warrants a death penalty

11:05.800 --> 11:07.800
A stroke is missing

11:08.200 --> 11:11.800
Your Majesty, the character "huang"
has the top stroke missing,

11:11.800 --> 11:13.400
thus implying that
Your Majesty is headless

11:13.400 --> 11:15.400
That warrants a death penalty

11:16.200 --> 11:19.800
A stroke is actually missing?
Bring me the essay

11:19.800 --> 11:21.200
Yes, Your Majesty

11:31.800 --> 11:36.200
The characters "bai" and "wang"
combine to form "huang"

11:36.200 --> 11:40.400
Are you suggesting that I'm suffering
from poor eyesight at old age?

11:40.600 --> 11:45.000
Your Majesty, your humble subject
really saw one stroke missing

11:46.200 --> 11:48.200
Look at it yourself!

11:52.680 --> 11:56.200
Your Majesty, there was
one stroke missing just now

11:56.200 --> 11:58.400
-His Lordship saw it too
-Utter nonsense!

11:59.000 --> 12:02.480
Lord Zha, besides your eyesight,
are your brains failing too?

12:05.800 --> 12:09.920
Wei Delu, what is your motive?
How could you cheat His Majesty?

12:18.200 --> 12:19.800
It's the ant!

12:21.800 --> 12:23.000
Thank you

12:27.200 --> 12:28.200
Thank you

12:30.800 --> 12:35.920
Wise is Your Majesty. There is
no mistake in the character

12:36.520 --> 12:39.800
Zha Daoguang,
you've been most audacious

12:39.800 --> 12:44.800
On account of your past loyalty,
I gave you a chance

12:44.800 --> 12:49.400
But you remained unrepentant and
tried to frame the honest and upright

12:49.400 --> 12:53.000
I have no use for
a disloyal man like you

12:53.200 --> 12:54.600
-Men!
-Yes, Your Majesty

12:54.600 --> 12:56.800
Have mercy, Your Majesty

12:57.200 --> 13:00.800
Throw Zha Daoguang and
Huang Xinxin into prison

13:00.800 --> 13:02.800
They'll be handed over
to the Board of Punishments

13:02.800 --> 13:06.000
Your humble subject realizes
his folly. Have mercy, Your Majesty

13:06.200 --> 13:09.920
-I'm innocent, Your Majesty!
-Have mercy, Your Majesty...

13:12.800 --> 13:17.400
There was cheating
in the Imperial Examination

13:17.400 --> 13:21.800
The chief examiner, Zha Daoguang,
has been found guilty

13:21.800 --> 13:26.400
I hereby pronounce Wei Delu
as this year's Top Scholar

13:26.600 --> 13:29.400
Wise is Your Majesty

13:30.200 --> 13:31.800
Thank His Majesty

13:33.000 --> 13:35.800
Thank you, Your Majesty

13:36.200 --> 13:38.800
Your humble subject
thanks Your Majesty

13:38.800 --> 13:42.400
You've suffered much injustice.
You may rise

13:43.200 --> 13:45.200
Thank you, Your Majesty

13:47.200 --> 13:51.200
Wei Delu, you're a man of fine looks

13:51.400 --> 13:55.400
If you could kick the bad habit of
uttering nonsense,

13:55.400 --> 13:57.600
you'd make a promising talent

13:58.000 --> 14:00.680
Your humble subject
will bear that in mind

14:01.200 --> 14:04.200
There is another person
I'd like to commend

14:04.200 --> 14:08.200
That I've recovered fully
should be credited to...

14:08.200 --> 14:11.200
Physician Mei Shouquan's
dedicated care

14:11.520 --> 14:13.600
Mei Shouquan, receive the edict

14:16.600 --> 14:19.400
Yes, Your Majesty

14:19.600 --> 14:23.520
-You may rise
-Thank you, Your Majesty

14:25.200 --> 14:29.200
Mei Shouquan, you shall be
the chief physician...

14:29.200 --> 14:31.800
overseeing the
Imperial Medical Academy

14:31.800 --> 14:35.200
You shall be my personal physician

14:39.200 --> 14:41.200
Thank you, Your Majesty

14:41.200 --> 14:45.400
But I am only a lowly commoner,
Your Majesty

14:45.400 --> 14:47.400
I dare not take up
such a responsibility

14:47.680 --> 14:51.200
Besides, I am used to
a life of freedom

14:51.200 --> 14:53.800
I may not be able to adapt to life
in the Palace

14:53.800 --> 14:56.200
Please appoint another capable man,
Your Majesty

14:56.400 --> 14:59.800
Should I feel unwell in future...

15:00.200 --> 15:04.800
Should Your Majesty feel unwell
in future,

15:05.200 --> 15:09.200
I promise I'll come to the Palace
to treat Your Majesty without delay

15:09.200 --> 15:11.400
Please grant this wish of mine

15:12.400 --> 15:16.000
All right. I shan't force you

15:17.400 --> 15:21.800
You shall be conferred
the title of Divine Physician

15:22.200 --> 15:24.600
You shall return to
your hometown in glory

15:25.400 --> 15:27.600
Thank you, Your Majesty

15:32.200 --> 15:34.400
Thank you so much, Your Highness

15:35.000 --> 15:39.400
You're a wonderful man
but for your wild talk

15:39.400 --> 15:43.000
Do watch your behaviour from now on.
Don't be so arrogant

15:43.200 --> 15:46.200
Be a good official
who cares for the people

15:49.200 --> 15:53.400
I'm worried that I may not be able
to do it, much as I want to do so

15:54.200 --> 15:56.200
Why did you say that?

15:56.400 --> 16:00.800
From Shi Yaoqian to Chen Daqi
to the scholars around me,

16:00.800 --> 16:04.000
they all see the office
as a place to build their wealth

16:04.200 --> 16:06.200
Once you're named the Top Scholar,

16:06.200 --> 16:10.000
you'll be surrounded by
apple-polishers who...

16:10.000 --> 16:13.800
will teach you how to get rich
using your official status

16:13.800 --> 16:16.600
Don't worry on that count.
I'm behind you

16:16.600 --> 16:19.200
I'll feedback to Father
on any misdemeanour

16:19.400 --> 16:22.200
Just do what you have to do
without reservation

16:22.200 --> 16:27.400
Thank you, Your Highness.
I will not let you down

16:28.200 --> 16:33.400
Your Highness, there is something
I'd like to highlight to you

16:34.400 --> 16:38.600
Beware of Ouyang Xiaotian

16:39.000 --> 16:43.200
What has he done? I sense
some misunderstanding between you

16:43.400 --> 16:46.400
Just be careful of him

16:46.400 --> 16:51.400
Ouyang Xiaotian is not
as simple as he seems

16:58.200 --> 17:00.000
I take my leave

17:01.400 --> 17:02.800
Take care

17:04.200 --> 17:07.800
Take care, Your Highness

17:21.680 --> 17:24.400
Congratulations!
Congratulations to both families

17:24.400 --> 17:29.800
All these years of efforts
have finally paid off

17:29.800 --> 17:34.400
Despite all the hardships,
Shou and Lu never gave up

17:34.400 --> 17:38.200
They only get to where they are today
because of their upright character

17:38.200 --> 17:40.200
You're finally stating facts

17:40.200 --> 17:44.200
But my Fu is still a fugitive

17:45.200 --> 17:49.200
Come on, he's only a physician

17:49.200 --> 17:51.800
He can't hold a candle
to the Top Scholar

17:51.800 --> 17:55.800
The Top Scholar is a talent
who runs the country

17:55.800 --> 17:57.600
The country depends on him

17:57.800 --> 18:01.000
My family will be
counting on your family then

18:01.000 --> 18:02.400
No problem!

18:02.600 --> 18:06.800
Will Shou be riding on horseback or
travelling in a sedan?

18:06.800 --> 18:10.000
On horseback, of course!
That will be so imposing

18:10.000 --> 18:12.400
No one can see who's inside the sedan

18:12.400 --> 18:15.600
Exactly! But the one on the horseback
is visible to all!

18:15.800 --> 18:20.600
Delu has done the family proud

18:20.800 --> 18:26.800
It's probably thanks to
the good deeds the family has done

18:26.800 --> 18:29.800
How many top scholars
are there each time?

18:29.800 --> 18:33.600
It's also the first time Ping'an Town
produces a top scholar

18:34.400 --> 18:38.200
Are you having me on?
Is my Shou really that capable?

18:38.400 --> 18:40.200
Princess Ruining invited him...

18:40.200 --> 18:43.200
to treat His Majesty
at the Hall of Golden Chimes

18:43.400 --> 18:46.200
He's done a deed of great merit

18:46.200 --> 18:48.200
Mother, there is more

18:48.200 --> 18:53.400
The Emperor has even presented
my brother with a...

18:53.400 --> 18:54.400
A tablet?

18:55.200 --> 18:57.200
Do you want your head to roll?

18:57.400 --> 19:00.200
It's the imperial title of
Divine Physician!

19:00.200 --> 19:02.200
Do you get it?

19:02.200 --> 19:08.400
I bet no one will dare
tell Shou off for putting on airs now

19:08.600 --> 19:09.600
Exactly!

19:11.200 --> 19:14.800
This unruly family certainly
engages in wild talk!

19:15.200 --> 19:19.000
You called us unruly?
Do you see yourself so high up?

19:19.000 --> 19:20.200
Of course!

19:20.200 --> 19:22.800
Don't you be so arrogant

19:22.800 --> 19:26.400
You'll have to come
to my son when you fall sick

19:26.400 --> 19:29.800
-You'll come a-begging!
-I dare say you'll come to us too

19:29.800 --> 19:32.400
I'm sure you'll have lawsuits
in time to come!

19:33.600 --> 19:37.800
Break it up!
Your sons have done you proud

19:37.800 --> 19:40.400
But my Fu is...

19:40.600 --> 19:45.600
-There she goes again
-Please stop making a scene

19:46.200 --> 19:50.200
Just what is that all about?
Now, why isn't Shou here yet?

19:50.800 --> 19:54.400
The hour has passed.
Did they run into some trouble?

19:54.400 --> 19:57.400
I know!
They must have run into bandits

19:58.400 --> 20:00.200
You and your foul mouth!

20:10.400 --> 20:12.200
Here

20:17.200 --> 20:19.800
Smells good.
Let me have some first

20:19.800 --> 20:23.800
No! Today is the day
the three of us turn 29

20:23.800 --> 20:27.000
Fu is on his way here.
Let's wait for him

20:27.200 --> 20:31.200
I'll wait. I waited years to be
the Top Scholar before I became one

20:32.400 --> 20:37.200
Don't talk about what happened
in the Capital when Fu is here

20:37.200 --> 20:41.200
You're now the Top Scholar and I,
a famed physician

20:41.200 --> 20:45.400
He'll feel lousy
if he knows he can't match up to us

20:45.400 --> 20:48.800
-That won't be nice
-You worry too much

20:48.800 --> 20:53.800
Fu isn't as petty as you. He'll be
happy over our achievements

20:53.800 --> 20:57.200
The successful don't talk about
past failures

20:57.200 --> 21:00.800
I'm not calling Fu petty.
I just don't wish to upset him

21:00.800 --> 21:03.400
But we can't keep what happened
from him, can we?

21:04.200 --> 21:08.600
Fine! Then we shall also tell him
about how you tried to hang yourself

21:08.600 --> 21:10.000
Shall we?

21:11.400 --> 21:14.800
We should be tactful
in deed and speech

21:14.800 --> 21:17.800
Let's not talk about the Capital
lest he gets upset

21:17.800 --> 21:19.200
I'm glad you realize that

21:20.200 --> 21:22.200
Brothers, I'm back!

21:22.800 --> 21:24.200
Fu!

21:27.200 --> 21:29.400
Happy Birthday!

21:29.800 --> 21:34.000
I knew you'd turn up. You never
failed to show up on our birthday

21:34.000 --> 21:37.800
Of course!
Are we just having the chicken?

21:37.800 --> 21:41.800
As if we'd be so stingy on ourselves.
Ruyi has gone to buy some food

21:41.800 --> 21:45.200
-I'll go and help Ma-jiejie
-Do you know where she is?

21:45.200 --> 21:47.800
-Yes
-What a sensible girl

21:50.600 --> 21:54.800
You have Miss Ma and
you have Shuangxi

21:54.800 --> 21:58.800
While both of you have
a lady by your side, I am...

22:01.000 --> 22:05.000
Don't be discouraged. You're the most
articulate among the three of us

22:05.000 --> 22:07.800
You've always been the patient sort

22:07.800 --> 22:12.800
For all we know, Her Highness may
have a change of heart down the road

22:12.800 --> 22:14.800
She'll come back to you

22:16.200 --> 22:21.200
Lu, you're an official now.
You'll have no lack of women

22:23.400 --> 22:27.000
How did you find out
I'd been made an official?

22:27.200 --> 22:30.200
Of course! When I arrived in
the city,

22:30.200 --> 22:32.600
I heard about how the people
welcomed home two persons

22:32.600 --> 22:36.400
While one is the Top Scholar,
the other is the Divine Physician

22:38.200 --> 22:41.400
But why are you holing up in here?
You should be celebrating out there

22:41.600 --> 22:45.400
The three of us are brothers.
We are one

22:45.400 --> 22:48.400
We'll only go out there
with you around

22:48.600 --> 22:52.400
We'll drink together and
enjoy ourselves

22:52.400 --> 22:54.400
-That's what I call happiness
-Well said!

22:55.400 --> 22:59.000
Do you still remember what we said
when we became sworn brothers?

22:59.000 --> 23:00.000
You bet!

23:01.000 --> 23:03.800
In the presence of The Trio,
I, Wei Delu...

23:03.800 --> 23:06.800
-I, Mei Shouquan...
-I, Wu Fuqi...

23:06.800 --> 23:09.400
Shall become sworn brothers
from now on

23:09.400 --> 23:12.400
-We'll fight together
-Share our food

23:12.400 --> 23:15.200
We'll play together

23:15.200 --> 23:20.800
We will share weal and woe
from now on!

23:21.200 --> 23:24.200
-The three of us are...
-Good brothers!

23:25.200 --> 23:27.800
-What happened?
-Let's try again

23:27.800 --> 23:30.600
-The three of us are...
-Good...

23:30.600 --> 23:31.800
Brothers...

23:33.400 --> 23:35.200
It's all right now

23:53.000 --> 23:57.800
While one of you is the Top Scholar,
the other is the Divine Physician

23:57.800 --> 24:00.400
I'm very happy for both of you

24:00.600 --> 24:03.200
Thank you.
Come, bottoms up

24:10.200 --> 24:13.800
Fu, your talent
will be recognized one day

24:13.800 --> 24:17.680
Don't be upset.
Your break will come

24:17.680 --> 24:19.800
I'm not upset

24:19.800 --> 24:24.800
Fu, great success doesn't come soon.
What matters is it will come

24:24.800 --> 24:29.000
We just have to work hard
and success will be ours

24:29.200 --> 24:33.000
-Don't despair
-Why should I despair?

24:33.000 --> 24:34.200
I'm not in despair

24:34.200 --> 24:38.000
If you feel like crying,
you may do so in my arms

24:38.200 --> 24:41.200
Do I look like I want to cry?

24:41.400 --> 24:45.200
Fu, we're brothers.
We know how you feel

24:45.200 --> 24:49.600
You're the strongest among us
but you also shed tears easily

24:49.800 --> 24:54.200
If you feel like crying, go ahead.
I'll lend you my shoulders

24:54.200 --> 24:56.200
My shoulders are more comfortable
than his arms

24:56.400 --> 24:58.000
You're crazy

24:58.200 --> 25:05.200
You think I'll feel inferior and sad
now that you've found success

25:05.200 --> 25:07.800
I really feel none of that

25:07.800 --> 25:12.800
I'll have you know that
I've found my goal in life

25:13.800 --> 25:16.800
You have?
Tell us about it

25:17.200 --> 25:19.200
Tree-planting!

25:19.800 --> 25:21.800
Tree-planting?

25:22.600 --> 25:28.800
That's right. You'll find it hard
to believe when I tell you the story

25:29.800 --> 25:33.200
I had a strange encounter
on the day I left Ping'an Town

25:33.400 --> 25:38.000
I ran into a mountain deity
who gave me a powerful right arm

25:38.200 --> 25:42.800
I can easily form a hole
in the ground with just one punch

25:42.800 --> 25:44.400
-Then I plant the tree
-Really?

25:44.400 --> 25:46.600
You don't believe me?

25:48.200 --> 25:50.200
Let me show you

26:02.200 --> 26:03.800
That was impressive!

26:04.400 --> 26:06.400
Now you believe me, huh?

26:15.600 --> 26:19.800
Can you feel my surging blood?

26:20.800 --> 26:25.000
I'm checking your pulse to see
if you've suffered any brain damage

26:26.200 --> 26:30.000
Fu, don't play the prank on me

26:30.000 --> 26:32.800
Did you trick us earlier?

26:33.800 --> 26:38.400
Lu, his pulse is normal. Looks like
he wasn't exaggerating things

26:40.400 --> 26:46.400
Believe me. Planting trees is good.
It's a noble act

26:46.400 --> 26:50.000
Generations after me will enjoy
the shade from the trees I plant

26:51.000 --> 26:53.800
It takes 10 years to grow a tree and
100 years to cultivate a man

26:54.200 --> 26:57.800
Though what I do now
may not reap immediate results,

26:57.800 --> 27:02.400
it will greatly benefit
the many generations to come

27:04.400 --> 27:06.200
You do have a point there

27:07.000 --> 27:10.600
Every vocation has its success story

27:11.800 --> 27:14.800
Since you have a heart
in planting trees,

27:15.000 --> 27:21.400
you may just become
a great gardener one day

27:23.200 --> 27:26.400
That's right!
A great gardener

27:30.400 --> 27:34.200
No one job is above or
beneath another

27:34.200 --> 27:41.600
Be one a top scholar,
a divine physician or a gardener,

27:41.600 --> 27:44.800
success will still come to one

27:47.200 --> 27:52.000
The three of us will see
good days ahead of us

27:53.200 --> 27:57.600
Look. Gone is the dark cloud
above your head

27:59.800 --> 28:01.200
It's gone

28:01.800 --> 28:06.200
Fu, given your special ability now,

28:06.200 --> 28:10.000
no one will dare tick you off
for being arrogant

28:11.200 --> 28:15.800
If the dark cloud comes back,
we will blow it away for you

28:19.200 --> 28:22.400
Your Lordship, before Mei Shouquan
left the Palace,

28:22.400 --> 28:27.800
he told His Majesty the illness
had been brought about by poison

28:27.800 --> 28:33.800
Enraged, His Majesty has ordered
to seek out the mastermind

28:34.800 --> 28:38.800
Then why did you come to me?
Let them investigate the matter

28:39.200 --> 28:43.200
It's a grave matter, Your Lordship

28:43.200 --> 28:47.800
The investigation will trace it to
the snow lotus from Your Lordship

28:48.200 --> 28:50.400
Don't you utter nonsense

28:50.400 --> 28:55.600
The snow lotus was recommended
as part of the treatment

28:55.600 --> 29:01.200
But we merely acted on
the order of Your Lordship

29:01.400 --> 29:10.000
Would His Majesty believe a loyal
marquis betrothed to his daughter...

29:10.200 --> 29:15.000
or a mediocre imperial physician
like you?

29:15.200 --> 29:18.400
Lord Yonghuan, aren't you vicious!

29:18.600 --> 29:21.800
Very well!
Just you wait and see!

29:27.400 --> 29:31.400
What do you want?

29:33.200 --> 29:37.000
Physician Luo, you know
how much you've gained from me

29:37.000 --> 29:39.800
You can't absolve yourself of blame
in this matter

29:40.200 --> 29:42.200
You have two options now

29:42.200 --> 29:46.400
Didn't you say you'd do your utmost
and lay down your life?

29:50.200 --> 29:55.400
If you die now, I promise your family
will be well taken care of

29:56.200 --> 30:01.800
Alternatively, your family
shall meet King of Hades

30:06.000 --> 30:12.200
Ouyang Xiaotian, I hope
you'll keep your promise and...

30:13.200 --> 30:15.400
take good care of my family

30:16.000 --> 30:23.200
Or I'll turn into a vicious ghost
and return to haunt you

30:39.800 --> 30:45.200
Your Majesty, your humble subject
regrets his actions

30:45.200 --> 30:48.400
Your humble subject deserves to die

31:00.600 --> 31:03.800
Physician Luo, you won't be lonely

31:03.800 --> 31:08.400
Physician Zhang and Physician Huang
will join you shortly

31:11.200 --> 31:15.400
Good fortune shall follow us
from now on! Cheers!

31:18.800 --> 31:20.800
How could you get yourselves
so drunk!

31:21.400 --> 31:25.200
Ruyi, why did you smash
our wine bottles?

31:26.600 --> 31:30.800
-Why were you so careless?
-Rather, I am worried!

31:30.800 --> 31:36.400
Worried? We are doing so well now.
You needn't worry about us

31:37.200 --> 31:39.800
Just look at the three of you!

31:39.800 --> 31:42.800
Ruyi, we've done nothing
to upset you

31:43.200 --> 31:47.400
Do you think you can make merry
now that your future looks rosy?

31:48.000 --> 31:51.400
It's true that
things are looking up for us

31:51.600 --> 31:54.800
I am the Top Scholar

31:55.200 --> 32:00.000
Shou has been given
the title of Divine Physician

32:01.000 --> 32:07.000
Fu is a very famous gardener

32:07.600 --> 32:11.400
A shame the titles are
too big for your heads!

32:14.800 --> 32:20.600
Spicy Woman, will you just
cut us some slack?

32:22.600 --> 32:25.800
My words may be jarring on your ears,
but I'll still say them

32:25.800 --> 32:28.800
Trials and tribulations
are lying in wait for you

32:29.200 --> 32:33.600
If you take my warning lightly,
disasters will befall you

32:38.200 --> 32:42.200
You're a hopeless bunch!
Shou, you're no different from them

32:42.200 --> 32:45.200
-You're an utter disappointment!
-Hear me out, Ruyi

32:45.200 --> 32:49.200
The two of them forced me
to drink with them

32:49.200 --> 32:51.200
I have nothing to do with it

32:55.200 --> 33:00.000
Miss Ma, how you love to scare us
with alarming talk

33:00.000 --> 33:03.400
What's wrong with the three of us
enjoying some wine together?

33:03.400 --> 33:05.200
I have your welfare at heart

33:10.200 --> 33:12.200
Ma Ruyi, you are a pain

33:12.200 --> 33:18.200
We're catching up on old times
but you've come to spoil the party

33:21.400 --> 33:23.800
Brother Fuqi,
Miss Ma has a point there

33:23.800 --> 33:26.800
Her words make sense

33:26.800 --> 33:28.400
What sense?

33:29.000 --> 33:33.000
It's unreasonable of you
to upset the three of us

33:33.400 --> 33:36.000
Ma Ruyi, leave!

33:38.400 --> 33:40.400
Ruyi! Ruyi, don't go

33:42.200 --> 33:45.800
-What has become of her?
-She... she...

33:45.800 --> 33:48.200
-Brother Fuqi!
-Ma Ruyi, come here!

33:50.600 --> 33:52.600
Stop teasing Ruyi

33:54.600 --> 33:57.600
I get it...
Ma Ruyi!

33:59.200 --> 34:00.880
Shuangxi, let's go!

34:04.520 --> 34:06.800
Stay here. I'll be going

34:07.200 --> 34:11.400
-What do you want?
-What is going on?

34:11.400 --> 34:16.400
Your fault! You got me so drunk.
I'll get a beating from Ruyi

34:34.480 --> 34:36.200
Zhang Guolao!

34:38.200 --> 34:39.800
Zhang Guolao!

34:40.200 --> 34:41.200
Quiet!

34:44.200 --> 34:45.400
Zhang Guolao!

34:47.200 --> 34:53.600
-What are you doing?
-What's wrong? You look mad

34:54.600 --> 34:59.400
You must help me be rid of
the Obedience Spell

34:59.400 --> 35:02.800
I'm in utter misery now

35:03.600 --> 35:08.800
The Obedience Spell has its pros too.
You learn what makes a virtuous woman

35:10.200 --> 35:14.200
You're responsible for the state
I'm in. Don't be so mean

35:15.400 --> 35:19.200
You can't blame me.
In a bid to save Mei Shouquan,

35:19.200 --> 35:23.800
you allowed Deity of Medicine
to put the curse on you

35:23.800 --> 35:28.200
I did warn you against falling in
love but you ignored my advice

35:28.400 --> 35:30.400
I didn't fall in love

35:30.400 --> 35:34.400
How can Mei Shouquan return to
Celestial Court with a monkey's body?

35:34.600 --> 35:36.800
I had the big picture in mind

35:36.800 --> 35:42.400
In that case, bear with it for now.
Ma-gu, go back!

35:42.400 --> 35:45.400
-I'm staying put
-Lord Erlang, you're here

35:45.600 --> 35:47.800
Go back, Ma-gu!

35:50.200 --> 35:53.200
The spell works all the time.
It's fun!

35:53.400 --> 35:55.800
Ma-gu, come back!

35:58.400 --> 36:00.200
Ma-gu, go back!

36:03.600 --> 36:07.800
Ma-gu... Forget it.
Let's just concentrate on my fishing

36:14.800 --> 36:18.800
A big fish!
Ma-gu, come back...

36:19.400 --> 36:22.200
I'm sorry, Ma-gu

36:28.400 --> 36:30.800
The three of them killed themselves?

36:31.200 --> 36:34.200
They'd plotted against His Majesty

36:34.600 --> 36:39.800
After they were exposed,
they killed themselves out of guilt

36:40.200 --> 36:43.000
Don't take it to heart, Your Highness

36:43.400 --> 36:45.400
Though they're dead,

36:45.400 --> 36:49.400
I don't understand why
they wanted to harm Father

36:49.400 --> 36:51.800
I believe there was a mastermind

36:52.800 --> 36:57.800
Indeed. In fact, I can't tear myself
away from this incident either

36:58.400 --> 36:59.400
You?

37:00.000 --> 37:04.600
Do you recall how the three
physicians argued over the diagnosis?

37:04.600 --> 37:08.800
Yes. In the end, they agreed on
using snow lotus to treat Father

37:10.000 --> 37:16.000
It was a conspiracy with
the envoy from Qie'erqi

37:16.000 --> 37:19.400
The envoy had presented me
with the snow lotus

37:19.400 --> 37:23.000
Then they suggested snow lotus
to treat His Majesty

37:23.000 --> 37:26.400
They wanted to kill His Majesty
through my hands

37:26.400 --> 37:33.000
Should the truth be found out,
I'll be deemed the guilty party

37:35.200 --> 37:37.800
But why did they do that?

37:38.200 --> 37:43.600
Qie'erqi has been eyeing our country,
hence the plot to harm His Majesty

37:44.200 --> 37:47.200
The three physicians
had served Father for years

37:47.200 --> 37:49.800
To think they committed treason
with another state

37:50.200 --> 37:52.200
A fair face hides a foul heart

37:52.200 --> 37:55.800
But the incident has finally
come to a close, Your Highness

37:55.800 --> 37:59.400
His Majesty has decided to sever
diplomatic ties with Qie'erqi

37:59.400 --> 38:01.600
Stop fretting over it, Your Highness

38:01.800 --> 38:07.400
I'll be making a trip to Ping'an.
Your Highness may want to join me

38:07.400 --> 38:09.200
You may take a holiday there

38:09.200 --> 38:12.200
All right, but on one condition

38:12.200 --> 38:13.200
Yes?

38:13.200 --> 38:16.400
Keep me company.
Don't leave me alone

38:16.400 --> 38:19.800
Spend every day with me and
don't argue with me

38:24.400 --> 38:27.200
Yes, Your Highness

38:31.680 --> 38:33.800
Your Excellency, someone is here
to lodge a complaint

38:34.200 --> 38:36.400
-Who?
-Wei Delu

38:36.600 --> 38:38.200
Magistrate Shi

38:39.600 --> 38:40.800
Magistrate Shi

38:44.400 --> 38:48.200
What may I do for you, Lord Wei?
Pardon my tardiness in receiving you

38:48.200 --> 38:55.800
Magistrate Shi, I'm sorry. They have
come to file a case against you

38:56.200 --> 39:00.600
Do you know what offences
you've committed?

39:01.200 --> 39:04.800
Utter nonsense!
What crimes have I committed?

39:05.200 --> 39:08.800
The cheek of you to accuse us
of uttering nonsense!

39:08.800 --> 39:14.200
You stole the cauldron and conspired
with Chen Daqi to sell fake drugs...

39:14.200 --> 39:16.800
to make money

39:17.200 --> 39:19.200
-You... you!
-What?

39:19.200 --> 39:23.400
You framed the innocent, abducted
a girl and tried to molest Ma Ruyi

39:23.400 --> 39:25.800
-Your crimes are unpardonable!
-I...

39:25.800 --> 39:30.800
What! You forced me to marry you.
That's another crime!

39:32.200 --> 39:35.800
You're an official and yet
you broke the law

39:35.800 --> 39:38.000
How shall you answer to everyone?

39:38.400 --> 39:41.800
-How shall you answer to us?
-Utter nonsense!

39:41.800 --> 39:43.800
You're setting me up!

39:43.800 --> 39:46.400
Everyone has got a case against you

39:46.600 --> 39:49.200
Ever since you became
the magistrate here,

39:49.200 --> 39:52.800
you've done nothing but bully the
people and make ill-gotten gains

39:53.000 --> 39:57.800
Just because you're the magistrate
doesn't make you above the law!

39:57.800 --> 40:03.000
You even sent guards after me
when I refused to marry you

40:03.000 --> 40:06.400
You even injured Brother Fuqi.
You're worse than a robber!

40:07.200 --> 40:10.600
You abused your authority.
That is a serious offence

40:10.600 --> 40:13.200
What will you do
if I hand this to His Majesty?

40:13.200 --> 40:16.200
-You're dead meat!
-Who is dead meat?

40:16.200 --> 40:18.600
-Him!
-Who is dead meat?

40:20.200 --> 40:22.200
We have a crowd here

40:22.400 --> 40:25.600
Save me, Your Lordship.
They want me dead

40:25.800 --> 40:30.800
I see. Lord Wei is newly-appointed.
A new broom sweeps clean

40:31.200 --> 40:36.000
Lord Wei, what has Magistrate Shi
done to warrant a death penalty?

40:36.200 --> 40:41.200
Your Lordship, his crimes are
all listed in this petition

40:41.400 --> 40:43.200
For your perusal, please

40:47.200 --> 40:49.800
That's a long list

40:50.200 --> 40:54.400
Magistrate Shi,
explain yourself to everyone

40:54.600 --> 40:57.200
Your Lordship, it's a setup

40:57.400 --> 41:00.200
Mei Shouquan, you found
the cauldron in Eastern Sea

41:00.200 --> 41:03.800
Eastern Sea is under the jurisdiction
of the court, so I took the cauldron

41:03.800 --> 41:04.800
You!

41:05.200 --> 41:09.200
Ma Ruyi stripped in my presence
but I got beaten up

41:09.200 --> 41:11.800
-What crime did I commit?
-Well....

41:11.800 --> 41:15.200
And you! You assaulted the constables

41:15.200 --> 41:16.800
-I...
-What!

41:17.200 --> 41:21.800
I took you as my wife legally

41:23.400 --> 41:27.800
-Your Lordship, I did no wrong
-That was a load of crap

41:28.000 --> 41:29.800
-Who uttered crap?
-You!

41:30.200 --> 41:35.200
You claimed he uttered nonsense.
So what makes me think you're not?

41:36.200 --> 41:38.200
We're the witnesses

41:38.200 --> 41:40.800
How about material evidence?

41:43.400 --> 41:46.200
Even if you had witnesses and
material evidence,

41:46.200 --> 41:49.800
Magistrate Shi is still
a court official

41:49.800 --> 41:53.400
He should be handed over to
the Board of Punishments

41:53.400 --> 41:56.200
What are you people
trying to do here?

41:56.400 --> 41:59.200
Lord Wei, you're the Top Scholar

41:59.200 --> 42:04.800
Who will answer to His Majesty
if he learns about this?

42:09.000 --> 42:11.800
Don't bite more than you can chew

42:16.200 --> 42:18.800
I'll take care of this

42:19.400 --> 42:22.800
You needn't fret over it

42:23.200 --> 42:25.800
Be on your way

42:26.400 --> 42:29.200
-We'll be going
-I'll go keep the laundry

42:34.200 --> 42:36.200
I'll go keep the laundry

42:36.200 --> 42:40.200
Thank you, Your Lordship.
I could have died at their hands

42:40.200 --> 42:44.200
Wei Delu has no regard for the law.
Are we going to indulge him?

42:44.200 --> 42:46.200
We must know when to retreat

42:46.400 --> 42:50.200
Wei Delu is throwing his weight about
as Her Highness is backing him

42:50.200 --> 42:52.400
Why take it up with him?

42:53.200 --> 42:56.800
Just wait and see.
His good days are coming to an end

42:56.800 --> 42:59.800
That is reassuring

43:02.200 --> 43:06.200
Is the pill cauldron really
that amazing?

43:06.200 --> 43:10.800
Yes. Mei Shouquan used it to
make drugs to remove the epidemic

43:15.200 --> 43:20.800
In that case, I wonder if it can be
used to make the elixir of life

43:21.400 --> 43:22.800
Certainly!

43:23.400 --> 43:25.200
In that case...

43:26.600 --> 43:29.800
I know what to do, Your Lordship

43:29.800 --> 43:33.400
I'll arrange for the cauldron to be
sent to Your Lordship's residence

43:33.400 --> 43:38.000
May longevity be Your Lordship's

43:43.200 --> 43:47.200
You're not a stupid man.
I've not used the wrong person

43:47.400 --> 43:49.200
I'll see to it now, Your Lordship

43:55.200 --> 43:57.200
Greetings, Your Lordship

43:57.200 --> 44:01.200
-Have you carried out my instruction?
-Yes. Except Her Highness'...

44:02.800 --> 44:03.800
Yes

44:05.200 --> 44:09.800
Except Her Highness' maid,
the rest of the people work for us

44:09.800 --> 44:11.200
Assign clever men

44:11.200 --> 44:16.400
They just need to report on who
Her Highness meets and what she does

44:16.400 --> 44:18.800
-Don't upset Her Highness
-Yes

44:19.000 --> 44:22.800
Something puzzles me. Why did Your
Lordship bring Her Highness along?

44:22.800 --> 44:24.800
Her presence will only impede us

44:24.800 --> 44:28.400
I had a hard time convincing her
I played no part in the poisoning

44:28.400 --> 44:31.000
I'll be worried if she stays
in the Capital

44:31.200 --> 44:35.200
I don't want any rumours
to affect our wedding plans

44:35.400 --> 44:38.200
Your Lordship doesn't need
Her Highness' assistance

44:38.200 --> 44:42.400
We have ample wealth and
a big army to serve our purpose

44:42.400 --> 44:46.800
We can easily charge up north
and catch them unawares

44:46.800 --> 44:50.800
Your Lordship will then ascend
the throne and rule the land

44:52.200 --> 44:53.200
Subtitled by A Han
